      "content": "[[FORMULA:Genetics_appendix1_formula329]]",
      "source_page": 895,
      "printed_page": 875,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "p895:b15"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        118.0,
        1457.0,
        833.0,
        1551.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Since $ \\sigma^{2}(\\overline{e}_{ij.}) = \\sigma_{e}^{2}/(n/2) $, it follows that $ \\overline{y}_{ij.} \\sim \\mathrm{N}(m_{ij}, 2\\sigma_{e}^{2}/n) $. Applying Equation A5.15e gives",
      "source_page": 896,
      "printed_page": 876,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "p896:b2"
      ],
      "bbox": [
