      "content": "while $E\\left(\\overline{y}_{i}\\mid\\mathrm{sire}_{i}=Q_{j}/Q_{\\ell}\\right)=\\mu+\\left(\\alpha_{j}+\\alpha_{\\ell}\\right)/2$. Putting these together gives",
      "source_page": 896,
