      "content": "where $ \\alpha_{j} $ is the average effect of allele $ Q_{j} $ and c is the marker-QTL recombination frequency. Since $ E(m_{i}) = 0 $, it follows that $ m_{i1} = -m_{i2} $ and hence",
      "source_page": 896,
